  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.0\n\t\t- Enhancements and Changes:\n\t\t-The class and method names have been updated to better reflect the inclusion of Local Government Areas (LGAs).\n\t\t- GetState(id) has been renamed to GetStateWithLgas(id)\n\t\t- GetStates has been renamed to GetStatesWithLgas\n\n\t\t- Usage changes\n\t\tvar states = Naija.GetStatesWithLgas();\n\t\tConsole.WriteLine(states.Count());\n\n\t\tvar state = Naija.GetStateWithLgas(36);\n\t\tvar imo = Naija.GetState(\"Imo\");\n\n\t\tBug Fixes\n\t\tNone in this release.\n\n\t\t- Future Enhancements:\n\t\t- Addition of utility methods for more specific queries.\n\t\t- Potential integration of population and demographic data.\n\t\t- API support for dynamic data fetching.",
